# Line endings are LF everywhere, matching .editorconfig. Without this file the
# convention depends on each contributor's core.autocrlf, and CI runs on both
# ubuntu and windows — a single CRLF checkout produces whole-file diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.exe binary
*.blockmap binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
